---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <main class="container page-shell">
    <header class="page-header">
      <span class="eyebrow">Consumer support</span>
      <h1>Friendly tech help for homes, families, and everyday devices.</h1>
      <p>
        ULLItech offers practical, local support for people who want straightforward advice, dependable repairs,
        and systems that fit the way they actually live and work.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="two-col">
        <div class="info-box">
          <h2>Break / Fix</h2>
          <p>
            From slow laptops and failing desktops to printers, Wi‑Fi issues, and frustrating device problems,
            Will helps homeowners get back to normal with honest guidance and efficient troubleshooting.
          </p>
          <ul class="timeline">
            <li>Computer and laptop repair</li>
            <li>Home office setup and device troubleshooting</li>
            <li>Printer, network, and internet support</li>
            <li>Performance tune-ups and upgrades</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="story-box">
          <h2>System builds</h2>
          <p>
            Need a new desktop for work, school, gaming, or family use? Build recommendations can be tailored
            to your budget and day-to-day needs without the pressure of complicated sales talk.
          </p>
          <ul class="timeline">
            <li>Custom desktop builds for home and remote work</li>
            <li>Upgrades for gaming, content creation, or study setups</li>
            <li>Setup, data migration, and troubleshooting</li>
            <li>Simple, practical recommendations that make sense</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="eyebrow">Why choose a local approach</span>
        <h2>Clear, friendly guidance without the tech jargon.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid service-grid">
        <article class="card">
          <h3>Personal service</h3>
          <p>
            Real, one-on-one help from someone who takes the time to explain the issue and what needs to happen next.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <h3>Practical fixes</h3>
          <p>
            Recommendations focused on what actually works for your setup, budget, and everyday routine rather than unnecessary upgrades.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <h3>Local support</h3>
          <p>
            Serving homeowners in Shelburne, Orangeville, and nearby communities with approachable, dependable service.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="info-box">
        <h2>Ready to get started?</h2>
        <p>
          Whether you need a quick repair, help with a home office setup, or a custom system build, I’d be glad to
          talk through the best next step.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="cta-button" href="tel:+14374882190">Call Will</a>
          <a class="ghost-button" href="mailto:will@ullitech.ca">Email Will</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
